{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">利嘉閣地產粉嶺-花都廣場分行高級聯席董事洪文鋒表示，該行最新促成粉嶺花都廣場6座中層A室的二手租務成交個案。單位實用面積約392方呎，採兩房間隔，外望內園景致。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">洪文鋒透露，新租客為家庭客，經 Walk-in 親臨門市尋覓心水租盤。租客鍾情屋苑周邊生活配套齊全，交通便利，加上單位間隔方正實用、環境清幽，睇樓後感到非常心儀，隨即決定以每月13,500元承租，折合實用面積呎租約34.4元，租金水平屬市場合理範疇。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">據悉，原業主於2023年以約502.8萬元購入上述單位，現成功租出，可享約3.22厘的租金回報。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T09:38:29.934130+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":255,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}